The problem is asking to create a program that transfigures a sequence of alphabets (or a phrase) to title case. In other words, the program should convert all the initial letters of each word to uppercase, and the remaining letters to lowercase.

Here's how you can do it in few different programming languages:

1. Python:
```python
def transfigure_sequence(text):
    return text.title()

print(transfigure_sequence('hello world!'))  # Output: 'Hello World!'
```

2. Java:
```java
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        System.out.println(transfigureSequence("hello world!"));  // Output: "Hello World!"
    }

    public static String transfigureSequence(String text) {
        String[] words = text.split(" ");
        StringBuilder sb = new StringBuilder();

        for (String word : words) {
            sb.append(Character.toUpperCase(word.charAt(0)));
            sb.append(word.substring(1).toLowerCase());
            sb.append(" ");
        }

        return sb.toString().trim();
    }
}
```

3. JavaScript:
```javascript
function transfigureSequence(text) {
    return text.replace(/\w\S*/g, function(word) {
        return word.charAt(0).toUpperCase() + word.substr(1).toLowerCase();
    });
}

console.log(transfigureSequence('hello world!')); // Output: 'Hello World!'
```

4. C#:
```csharp
using System;
using System.Globalization;

class Program
{
    static void Main()
    {
        Console.WriteLine(TransfigureSequence("hello world!"));  // Output: "Hello World!"
    }

    static string TransfigureSequence(string text)
    {
        TextInfo myTI = new CultureInfo("en-US", false).TextInfo;
        return myTI.ToTitleCase(text.ToLower());
    }
}
```

All of these programs take a phrase ('hello world!' in this case) and convert it to title case (to 'Hello World!'). The key function is `title()` in Python, `ToTitleCase()` in C#, `toUpperCase()` in JavaScript and `Character.toUpperCase()` in Java. These functions are used to change the case of the first letter of each word to uppercase. The remaining letters are transformed to lowercase using `toLowerCase()`.

