Please note that this function works properly only if n is no less than 2, since 1 is not considered as a prime number and it is also not included in the 'sieve' dictionary. If you want to include 1 in the range, you need to initialize the 'sieve' dictionary starting from 1, and manually set 'sieve[1]' to be False.

