Below is a simple Java application that calculates the number of days left until the end of the current year.

In the Java8 Date/Time API, `ZonedDateTime`, `LocalDate`, `YearMonth`, and `Period` classes are used to calculate the number of days left in the current year.

```java
import java.time.LocalDate;
import java.time.Period;
import java.time.YearMonth;
import java.time.ZoneId;
import java.time.ZonedDateTime;

public class DaysUntilEndOfYear {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        //Get the current date
        ZonedDateTime today = ZonedDateTime.now(ZoneId.systemDefault());
        LocalDate todayLocalDate = today.toLocalDate();

        //Get the last day of the current year
        YearMonth yearMonth = YearMonth.of(today.getYear(), 12); // December
        LocalDate lastDayOfYear = yearMonth.atEndOfMonth();

        //Calculate the period/difference between the current date and the end of year
        Period period = Period.between(todayLocalDate, lastDayOfYear);

        System.out.println("Number of days left until the end of the year: " + period.getDays());
    }
}
```
Please note that since `Period#getDays` only provides the days component, it will give the correct value until the last month of the year starts. To get a more accurate number of days left in the year, use the below way,

```java
import java.time.LocalDate;
import java.time.temporal.ChronoUnit;

public class DaysUntilEndOfYear {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        //Get the current date
        LocalDate today = LocalDate.now();

        //Get the last day of the current year
        LocalDate lastDayOfYear = LocalDate.of(today.getYear(), 12, 31);

        //Calculate the number of days between today and the end of year
        long daysUntilEndOfYear = ChronoUnit.DAYS.between(today, lastDayOfYear);

        System.out.println("Number of days left until the end of the year: " + daysUntilEndOfYear);
    }
}
```
This will provide a more accurate number of remaining days in the year, taking into account all remaining days in the current month plus all days in following months.

