Above solution will work perfectly fine, however the time complexity is O(n^2). In terms of complexity this is not so good solution. 

Consider a better solution using dictionary(Hash Map) in python. This solution will reduce time complexity to O(n) which is more efficient way of solving problem. 

```python
def twoSum(nums, target):
    hash_map = {}
    for i in range(len(nums)):
        complement = target - nums[i]
        if complement in hash_map:
            return [hash_map[complement],i]
        else:
