To display PDF files located on a remote server, consider the following steps instead:

1. Retrieve the document as a `byte array`, not as plain text via BufferedReader. PDFs are binary files and can't properly be read as text or lines.

2. Use a service and a controller method in Spring to retrieve and send PDF as an outputstream in the HTTP response.

