The search function now provides prefix search facility. Given a prefix, it traverses down the trie to the node representing the last character of the prefix then calls the private method _getWordsFromNode to get a list of all words in the trie starting with the given prefix.

This efficient search, insertion and memory management ensures that the trie can handle large datasets of strings with common prefixes.

