&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;
For instance:&lt;br&gt;
The collection $\{3, 4, 5\}$ constructs a convex polygon with sides $3$, $4$, and $5$ (a triangle).&lt;br&gt;
The collection $\{6, 9, 11, 24\}$ constructs a convex polygon with sides $6$, $9$, $11$, and $24$ (a quadrilateral).&lt;br&gt;
The collections $\{1, 2, 3\}$ and $\{2, 3, 4, 9\}$ fail to construct any convex polygon.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

