Here's a Python solution utilizing the cocktail shaker sort technique:

```python
def cocktail_shaker_sort(unsorted):
    for i in range(len(unsorted)-1, 0, -1):
        is_swapped = False

        for j in range(i, 0, -1):
            if unsorted[j] < unsorted[j-1]:
                unsorted[j], unsorted[j-1] = unsorted[j-1], unsorted[j]
                is_swapped = True

        for j in range(i):
            if unsorted[j] > unsorted[j+1]:
                unsorted[j], unsorted[j+1] = unsorted[j+1], unsorted[j]
                is_swapped = True

        if not is_swapped:
            return unsorted

    return unsorted

