3. The main function is the entry point for the program. This function initializes the input array and handling function calls. It prints the array before and after removing duplicates. We sort the array beforehand because removeDuplicates function requires the duplicates in the array to be next to each other.

The time complexity is O(n), because the array is iterated just once.

The space complexity is O(1), because no extra space is used.

