Here is a basic guide to developing a server application using Node.js:

Installation:
Make sure you have Node.js installed on your machine. You can download it from the official Node.js site. After installation, use `npm` (comes with node.js) to install following packages express, http, https, http-proxy, fs, cors, and cookie-parser.

