We use both http and https modules to make our server compatible with both HTTP/HTTPS requests. Express is used for managing different routes, middlewares, and responses. With 'cors' and 'cookie-parser' Express middleware we ensure that CORS policies are adhered to and that cookies can be parsed correctly from incoming requests.

