DP also avoids repeated computations by storing intermediate results in a cache (dictionary in this case).

```python
def fibfib(n: int):
    if n < 0:
        return "Invalid input"
    cache = {0: 0, 1: 0, 2: 1}
    def recurse(n):
        if n not in cache:
            cache[n] = recurse(n - 1) + recurse(n - 2) + recurse(n - 3)
        return cache[n]
    return recurse(n)
```

