If the list contains more than one element, the function calculates the difference between successive elements in the list. 

If the `strict` flag is set to True, the function checks if all differences are greater than 0 (for monotonically increasing) or less than 0 (for monotonically decreasing). If any of the conditions are satisfied, it returns True; otherwise, False.

