```java
@Bean
public JAXContextFactory jaxbFactory() {
    return new JAXContextFactory() {
        @Override
        public JAXBContext getContext(Class<?> type) throws JAXBException {
            return JAXBContext.newInstance(type);
        }
    };
}
```

3. Now, add the jaxb decoder to your feign configuration:

```java
@Bean
public Decoder feignDecoder() {
    return new JAXBDecoder(jaxbFactory());
}
